<title>USA: Blackhawk Bancorp completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Blackhawk Bancorp completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>BELOIT, Wis. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blackhawk Bancorp Inc on Friday said it completed its $4.2 million acquisition of Rochelle Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>The acquisition includes a $48 million asset thrift and a $2 million asset financing subsidiary, Blackhawk said.</p>
<p>Blackhawk shares fell 1/2 to 11-1/4 Friday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
